### Pruebas manuales de POST /accounts y /accounts/:id/balances (REST Client de VS Code). Datos ficticios.
### Ejecútalas en orden. Si ya existe la cuenta de prueba, la primera da 409: cambia last4.
### Los casos 5 a 8 usan el id 1: cámbialo por el que te devolvió el caso 1 (o 2).
@host = http://localhost:3001
@token = pega-aqui-el-accessToken-de-auth.http

### 1. Cuenta sin saldo inicial -> 201 { "id": ... }
POST {{host}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ahorros",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "1357",
  "accountType": "savings"
}

### 2. Cuenta con saldo inicial negativo (sobregiro) -> 201
POST {{host}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Corriente",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "2468",
  "accountType": "checking",
  "openingBalanceCents": -5000000,
  "asOf": "2026-03-10"
}

### 3. La misma cuenta otra vez -> 409
POST {{host}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ahorros",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "1357",
  "accountType": "savings"
}

### 4. Saldo inicial sin fecha -> 400
POST {{host}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ahorros",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "3690",
  "accountType": "savings",
  "openingBalanceCents": 100000
}

### 5. Confirmar un saldo -> 201 { "id": ... }
POST {{host}}/accounts/1/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "asOf": "2026-04-01", "balanceCents": 250000000 }

### 6. La misma fecha otra vez -> 409
POST {{host}}/accounts/1/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "asOf": "2026-04-01", "balanceCents": 260000000 }

### 7. Una cuenta que no existe -> 404
POST {{host}}/accounts/999/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "asOf": "2026-04-01", "balanceCents": 1000 }

### 8. Un id que no es número -> 400
POST {{host}}/accounts/abc/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "asOf": "2026-04-01", "balanceCents": 1000 }
